            "detailed_description": "Torgar is 4th in line to rule the Splitbeard clan of dwarves. He is also kind of crazy. These are the reasons, he decided to pack a lunch and nothing else, before heading into the long abandoned Deepgold Mine, looking for the shards of an artifact that will give Torgar ultimate power - The Mastery Crystal!<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Turn-based adventuring!<br></li><li>Find 7 crystal shards to WIN!<br></li><li>Permadeath. No SAVE! <br></li><li>Procedural dungeons. Every level is different.<br></li><li>Upgrade weapons and armor as you go.<br></li><li>Uncover lore.<br></li><li>Find food and potions to stay alive.<br></li><li>Break things and find secret treasure!<br></li><li>Learn special abilities, as Torgar levels up.</li></ul><br>Too easy? Try hard or nightmare setting.",
